WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.334
The robot arm approaches the black bowl resting on the small wooden stand from above, grasps it, lifts it, and moves it to the left to place it onto the pink-rimmed plate.

2
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Move arm down and left to approach the black bowl on the stand from above

3
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Grasp the black bowl with the gripper

4
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Lift the bowl and move it to the left towards the plate

5
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.500
Lower the bowl onto the plate and open the gripper to release it
